WHEREAS to permit a resolution of the site plan matter currently before the Ontario Land Tribunal, a modification to the Details of the Zoning for 200 Baribeau is supported by Planning staff;
THEREFORE BE IT RESOLVED that the Details of the Zoning contained within Document 2, section 1, clause b), to the report on 200 Baribeau be amended as follows:
BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED that pursuant to subsection 34(17) of the Planning Act, no further notice be given.
